    GrimLib — Premium Roblox UI Library
    • Rounded corners via UICorner
    • Neon dark-blue outer glow (UIStroke + drop-shadow image)
    • Smooth PC drag (InputChanged globally) + Touch drag
    • Fixed dropdown positioning (AbsolutePosition tracked)
    • Mobile + PC support throughout
    • Compatible API with LinoriaLib (Toggles / Options / same method names)
--]]

